    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c27b3ab3c8@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Corporation (NYSE:SYK) announced that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly dividend of&nbsp;$0.47 per share payable on&nbsp;October 31, 2018&nbsp;to shareholders of record at the close of business on&nbsp;September 28, 2018, representing an increase of approximately 11% versus the prior year and unchanged from the previous quarter.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2018/Stryker-declares-a-047-per-share-quarterly-dividend/default.aspx\">See full press release here</a>.</p>\n",
